US-006 shipped on `ralph/us-006` (commit `ee726b4`).

What landed:
- `src/widgets/Widget.tsx` — shared container with 1px top accent rail, 28×28 round icon, eyebrow + title stack, status badge (`Completed` / `In progress` / absent), optional footer with `--border` top divider, no body padding by default.
- `src/widgets/registry.ts` — `widgetRegistry: Record<WidgetType, { component, label, icon, accentVar }>` for all 6 types; lucide icons FileText/FlaskConical/Target/Code/Terminal/Layers; custom falls back to `--accent` (no `--widget-custom` token exists).
- 6 placeholder components under `src/widgets/<Name>/<Name>Placeholder.tsx`.
- `/test-widgets` demo route renders all six with mixed statuses + 2 footers.
- Quality: `typecheck` ✓, `lint` ✓ (0 warn), `test` ✓ (57/57), `build` ✓ (7 routes).
- Browser-verified light + dark via playwright; 6 widgets, 6 distinct rail colors, identical 68.18px header heights, no console errors. Screenshots at `/tmp/us-006-light.png` and `/tmp/us-006-dark.png`.

Progress log appended at `scripts/ralph/progress.txt` (kept in the main repo, not the worktree).
